<div id="urduTextPath">امام حسین (ع)/ابنِ علی جو باغِ رسالت لُٹا چکا</div>
<p>ibn-e- ali jo baagh-e- risaalat lutaa chuka<br />
bhai ki aur baap ki doulat lutaa chuka<br />
poonji haram ki apni bizaa- at lutaa chuka<br />
sab kuch baraa-e- baqshish-e- ummat lutaa chuka</p>

<p>baaqi koi shahido'n ke daftar me ab nahi<br />
juz aabid-e- mareez koi ghar me ab nahi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tanha khade the fouj me shaah-e- falak weqaar<br />
jo aayi chaar simth se phir fouj-e- bad sheyar<br />
dekha ke hai niyaam me hyder ki zulfeqaar<br />
jurrat huwi har ek ko badh kar lagaaye waar</p>

<p>yaad-e- quda me shaah ne sab kuch bhulaa diya<br />
jab zaqm khaaya shukr kiya muskuraa diya<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>tukde huwa jabee'n se kamar tak tan -e- imaam<br />
ghabra gaya faras pa to ye bole shah-e- anaam<br />
aye zuljanaah yaha'n se hataana na ek gaam<br />
ab jung bhi tamaam hai aur ham bhi hai tamaam</p>

<p>ghere huwe hai fouj-e- ajal sadde raah hai<br />
jaayega ab kaha'n ke yahi'n qatlgaah hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>muztar na ho lage to lage nawake sitam<br />
kuch gham nahi jo padhti hai talware'n dam badam<br />
maare na dam jo tan se ho sou baar sar qalam<br />
raahat ke dukh samajhte hai raah-e-quda me ham</p>

<p>paida huwe hai dard-o- musibat ke waaste<br />
ye sab qubool hai hame ummat ke waaste<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>mujh ko na qatl hone ka gham hai na kuch malaal<br />
ghar ki hai ab na fikr na bachhou ka hai qayaal<br />
jaana qareeb hai soo-e- darbaar-e- zuljalaal<br />
ye fikr hai ke dekhiye hota hai kya ma'aal</p>

<p>mursil bhi thartharaate hai is baargaah me<br />
kya nazr leke jaau janaab-e- ilaah me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehte the ke sar pa lagi tegh aab'daar<br />
naiza sinaa'n ka hogaya seene ke aar paar<br />
girne lage jo zee'n se imaam-e- falak wiqaar<br />
baithaa zamee'n pa tek ke ghutnou'n ko raah waar</p>

<p>ghash me jigar pakad ke ba dard-o- alam gire<br />
sambhlaa gaya na qaak pa shaah-e- umam gire<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>di badh ke paik ne pisar-e- saad ko qabar<br />
ghode se girpada asadullah ka pisar<br />
bash-shaash hoke shimr se bola wo qairahsar<br />
ja jald jaa nabi ke nawaase ko qatl kar</p>

<p>ghul ho dilaawari ka teri shehr shehr me<br />
qanjar wo khainch le jo bujhaaya ho zeher me<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qanjar pakad ke shimr chala aasti'n chadhaaye<br />
bolaa ye ibn-e- saad ke qooli bhi saath jaaye<br />
dono laee'n jo laasha-e- sarwar ke paas aaye<br />
pahlu se fatema ne sadaa di ke haaye haaye</p>

<p>qanjar liye huwe sitam ejaad aaye hai<br />
chounko hussain zibha ko jallad aaye hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rooh-e- janaab-e- fatema zehra ne di sadaa<br />
sadqe mai is labo'n ke is aawaaz par fidaa<br />
is ka nahi qayaal ke kat-ta hai ab gala<br />
ye sabr marhaba mere mazloom marhaba</p>

<p>tukde hai jism pyaas se honto'n pe jaan hai<br />
aye laal marte waqt bhi ummat ka dhyaan hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>kyu kar kahu'n tataawule shimr-e- sitam sheyaar<br />
pyase gale pa shah ki rakhi tegh aabdaar<br />
ghar se idhar nikal padi zainab jigar figaar<br />
chillaayi mu najaf ki taraf karke ek baar</p>

<p>halq-e- hussain kat-ta hai qanjar ki dhaar se<br />
ya murtuza ali nikal aao mazaar se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ya sher-e- kirdagaar ulatdo jahaan ko<br />
faryaad se hilaado zamee'n aasmaan ko<br />
karte hai zibha ahl-e sitam mehmaan ko<br />
ya mustafa bachaalo mere bhaai jaan ko</p>

<p>shamsheer chalne paaye na pyaase ke halq par<br />
rakh deeje halq apna nawase ke halq par<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehke soo-e- maqtale shah-e-umam chali<br />
mu apna peet'ti huwi ba dard -o-gham chali<br />
uth kar kabhi giri to kabhi do qadam chali<br />
aur waa'n gulu-e- shaah pa tegh-e- do dam chali</p>

<p>pahonchi to qatema tha shah-e- mashraqain ka<br />
shimr-e- laee'n ke haath me tha sar hussain ka<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>